/E (The Kokernag area is condensed with a variety of picnic spots , natural surroundings and exuberant mountainous habitat. The clean and translucent natural drinking water is available almost at all tourist attractions within the circuit. It has the potential to enthrall nature lovers and trekkers through its beautiful and charming landscape ,mountain passes and high altitude water bodies / lakes. The trekking routes and water bodies enshrine the beautiful springs of Mawarnag & Ichonag in Ahlan Gadole area , Choharnag, a place having 04 natural lakes including one of the biggest high altitude water bodies spread across 178 kanals of land on the Margan Top and Famber Nag in the same area. Besides the Springs of Achabal, Andoo and Kokernag are very famous for their pristine natural drinking water. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1 2]
