/T ( Kokernag-Vailoo-Ahlan-Gadole Circuit is imbued with the treasure of natural beauties. The resting pad offered at the merging spot of Mawar Nallah and     Poshbagh Nallah at Phatan Ahlan serves as a base for tourists and trekkers,  charmed by the beauty of water body Mawar Nag and Eicho Nag on Eastern Side and Poshpathri on the Southern Side. Some Tourists even like to rest in the glade of pine trees at Zampathri. The famous Monastery of Hazrat Shah Asar Din \(RA\) is situated on the Northern bank of Eicho Nallah at Eichu Gadole 5 KMs away from Vailoo. At this place Four Springs add to the glamour of the locale.)
